# Plant Identifier — Pl@ntNet API key (server-side only, never committed).
# Get a free key at https://my.plantnet.org (free tier: daily identification quota).
#
# Local dev with `netlify dev` reads this file. In production, set the same
# variable in the Netlify dashboard: Site settings -> Environment variables.
PLANTNET_API_KEY=your-plantnet-api-key-here
